WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.302
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.637
Shaq and I will take turns
facing our backs to the curtain.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.172
Behind the curtain
will be something

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.406
neither of us have seen before.

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.375
Could be people,
objects, anything.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.945
We have 45 seconds
to try to get the other person

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.413
to guess what's behind them.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.716
You can say anything you want
or use gestures.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:19.118
You just can't say
any of the words on the card.

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:20.820
Shaq, you will be
guessing first.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.589
Let's get into position.

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:25.158
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.696
Is the room really spinning?
-Yeah.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.964
-Okay, good. Perfect.
All right. Ready, buddy?

00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:37.036
Uh, here we go.
Okay. Open the curtain.

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:40.539
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:42.474
Wow. Okay.

00:00:42.474 --> 00:00:45.078
President. Stovepipe hat.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:47.313
-Abraham Lincoln.
-Yeah.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:50.283
Mike Myers.
The voice of this cartoon movie.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.852
He's a monster. He's green.

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:55.821
-SpongeBob SquarePants.

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:58.791
-No. Green.
Like a troll type of thing.

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:01.527
Like an ogre.

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.863
Cartoon.
There was like four of them.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.064
-Oh. Shrek.
-Yeah.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.467
And, then, it's a beverage --
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.634
Gosh!

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:10.336
Can we see what it is?
-Come on, Jimmy!

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.171
-Sorry about that.
I got to go faster.

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:13.973
I got to go faster.
You almost got it.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.276
Abraham Lincoln...

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:17.643
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:20.246
...and Shrek sharing
a milkshake.

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:22.215
And that's probably what it was.
I was going to say milkshake.

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:24.083
Sorry I didn't get to it.
All right. Here we go.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.251
You can close the curtain now.

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:29.255
Now it's my turn.
It's my turn to guess.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:34.293
I'm going to do this. All right.
Shaq, grab the card.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:37.463
And open the curtain
when you can.

00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:40.233
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.902
-You see them in New York.
-The Knicks.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:46.105
-They're not rats,
but they have long tails also.

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:47.573
-Pigeons?
-They're in parks.

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:50.243
-Pigeons. Squirrel.
-Yes.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:54.280
Black guys don't use it, but
white guys use it at the beach.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.315
-Sunscreen?
-Yes.

00:01:56.315 --> 00:01:58.151
-Wah! Wah!
-Baby.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.386
-Yes. Put them all together.
-Oh, yeah. What was it again?

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:04.090
A baby wearing sunscreen --
-The little animal.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.225
-A squirrel is putting
sunscreen on a baby.

00:02:06.225 --> 00:02:08.161
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:11.263
Let me see that.

00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:15.335
Wow! Oh, wow!

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:18.004
That's unbelievable.
That is unbelievable.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:20.206
Wow. Well, they're buddies.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.641
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:24.510
I don't know. All right.
Here we go. All right.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.713
-You use sunblock?
-Some things just -- Yeah, I do.

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.748
-I never use sunblock.
-You don't use it, yeah, no.

00:02:29.748 --> 00:02:32.318
Did not know that.
-We don't need it, right, Quest?

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.087
We don't need that.
-Nah.

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:36.589
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:40.160
-All right. Here we go.
Open the curtain.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:45.097
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:47.266
All right. She's --

00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:49.135
-Statue of Liberty.
-Yes.

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:53.072
When you celebrate in a
football game in the end zone.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.840
-Touchdown.
-You do a --

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.376
-Dance. Celebration.

00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:59.312
-If you're the greatest of all
time, you're also called...

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:01.147
-The GOAT.
-Yeah. Put them together.

00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:02.881
-Statue of Liberty
celebrating with a goat.

00:03:02.881 --> 00:03:04.250
-Yes! That's correct!

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.118
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:06.118 --> 00:03:09.955
♪♪

00:03:09.955 --> 00:03:12.057
Wow. At one point,
the Statue of Liberty

00:03:12.057 --> 00:03:13.693
was flossing at one point.

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:16.061
Doing a little floss.
There you go. Not bad.

00:03:16.061 --> 00:03:18.230
That's pretty cool.
That's fantastic.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.567
All right. Here we go.
Please close the curtain.

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:23.936
Thank you. The referee
looked a little disturbed.

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:25.404
-He did.

00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:27.473
-All right. Here we go.
It's the last one right here.

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:29.675
-Last one?
-This is for all the money.

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:32.144
Do you do that?
High-fiving when you do that?

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:34.213
Do you do that, like,
with your teammates and stuff?

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:35.981
-Only with my closest friends.

00:03:35.981 --> 00:03:37.516
[ Audience awws ]

00:03:37.516 --> 00:03:39.952
-I love you, dude.
-Love you, too, brother.

00:03:39.952 --> 00:03:42.288
-What's your nickname for me?
Do you remember?

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:43.589
-Boy Boy.

00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:47.293
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:48.928
-Boy Boy. All right.
-Yeah.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.063
-Let's see what's
behind me right now.

00:03:51.063 --> 00:03:54.033
[ Laughs ] Here we go.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:55.768
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:58.871
-He has a flat head like
Charles Barkley, and he's green.

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:02.107
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.107 --> 00:04:03.242
And he has that thing --
-Frankenstein.

00:04:03.242 --> 00:04:06.179
-Yes. Boing. When you jump.

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:08.481
-Jumping on -- Trampoline.
-Yep.

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:10.349
[ Humming ]

00:04:10.349 --> 00:04:12.451
-Lollipop.
-Yes. Put them all together.

00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:15.121
-Frankenstein
licking a lollipop,
jumping on a trampoline?

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:17.323
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:19.558
♪♪

00:04:19.558 --> 00:04:22.695
Oh, my gosh. Oh, my gosh.

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:25.465
That is just bizarre stuff.
Shaquille O'Neal, everybody.

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:27.233
-Thank you.

